# Asset files directory
# 
# This directory should contain:
# - icon.png (main app icon)
# - icon.ico (Windows icon)
# - notification-icon.png (notification icon)
# - tray/tray-icon.png (system tray icon - Linux)
# - tray/tray-icon.ico (system tray icon - Windows)  
# - tray/tray-icon-Template.png (system tray icon - macOS)
# - tray/tray-icon-notification.png (tray icon with notification badge - Linux)
# - tray/tray-icon-notification.ico (tray icon with notification badge - Windows)
# - tray/tray-icon-notification-Template.png (tray icon with notification badge - macOS)